Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:05.78,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(948.571,910.286)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:16.09,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(953.143,911.429)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.94,0:00:05.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,今天是2025年11月3日
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.94,0:00:05.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Today is November 3rd, 2025.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.92,0:00:08.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,还能和各位交谈的感觉真好
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.92,0:00:08.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It feels great to still be able to talk to you,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.52,0:00:11.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但这可能是我在YouTube的最后一个视频
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.52,0:00:11.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but this might be my final video on YouTube.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.34,0:00:18.93,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为如各位所见 我的副频道已被YouTube封禁
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.34,0:00:18.93,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The reason being, my secondary channel has been terminated off of YouTube, as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.66,0:00:22.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,显然我对此无能为力
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.66,0:00:22.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And obviously I can't do nothing about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.52,0:00:26.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们将共同提交申诉 看看这次能走多远
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.52,0:00:26.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're going to submit the appeal together and see how far it gets us now.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.34,0:00:30.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这一切的起因是人工智能系统
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.34,0:00:30.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The reason for this happening is AI.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.28,0:00:37.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它错误判定我的频道与某个因三次版权警告被封禁的频道存在关联
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.28,0:00:37.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It wrongfully concluded my channel was associated with a channel that was terminated for three copyright strikes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如各位所见 这里有一堆象形文字
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As you can see, there are a bunch of hieroglyphs.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.50,0:00:42.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我觉得是日文汉字
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.50,0:00:42.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I think it's kanji.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.08,0:00:48.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不知为何系统将我的副频道与某个日本用户关联起来
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.08,0:00:48.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And somehow it associated my secondary channel with some Japanese guy,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.70,0:00:51.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而我显然与其毫无瓜葛
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.70,0:00:51.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which I clearly don't have an association with.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我根本不知道那是哪个频道
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I don't freaking know what channel that is.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.58,0:01:02.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,更没想到仅凭人工智能就能直接执行封禁频道如此严厉的措施
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.58,0:01:02.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And I had no idea such drastic measures like channel termination were allowed to be processed by AI and AI only.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.68,0:01:07.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因此我想向美好的社区作最后告别
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.68,0:01:07.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And therefore I want to say my final goodbye to my gorgeous community.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为我必须做最坏打算
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Because I'm assuming the worst case scenario,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就像2023年那样
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,just like in 2023.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当时我的频道濒临封禁
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,My channel gets terminated,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.98,0:01:16.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,却几乎无人关注
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.98,0:01:16.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and almost no one bats an eye.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.04,0:01:25.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs75}那时因三个不实社区警告 我的频道濒临封禁 我却无法打破人为的信息茧房
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.04,0:01:20.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I couldn't break through a manufactured echo chamber back in 2023
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.81,0:01:25.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,when my channel was on the verge of being terminated for three false community strikes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.92,0:01:27.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当时几乎没人伸出援手
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.92,0:01:27.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Almost no one helped me back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.82,0:01:30.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,事件没能引起广泛关注
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.82,0:01:30.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It wasn't made popular.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,关键问题在于缺乏曝光度
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The big problem was there was no exposure.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.98,0:01:36.91,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的科技圈同仁们或许根本没看到我的求助呼声
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.98,0:01:36.91,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,My fellow tech colleagues just didn't see my cries for help, probably.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这次又会有什么不同呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What makes this time different?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.62,0:01:44.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,以如此悲伤又突然的方式收场实在令人遗憾
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.62,0:01:44.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So it's really unfortunate we have to end on such a sad note and so abruptly.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.54,0:01:48.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,此刻我已彻底失去希望
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.54,0:01:48.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I really just lost all hope at this point.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.66,0:01:50.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,原本有几个宏大的计划
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.66,0:01:50.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I had a couple huge projects in mind,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.94,0:01:55.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但在人工智能时代的浪潮下恐怕难以实现
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.94,0:01:55.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but it seems like they won't be fulfilled thanks to the age of AI we're living in.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,此刻我提出申诉
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So here I am, making an appeal.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.00,0:02:02.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,恳请平台进行人工审核
Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.00,0:02:02.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And I'm just asking for a manual review here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.94,0:02:06.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个频道所剩时间无几
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.94,0:02:06.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time left until this channel gets terminated as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.34,0:02:10.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是我最后一次请求大家
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.34,0:02:10.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And so, I ask you, for one last time,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请分享这段视频
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,please share this video,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.70,0:02:13.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请让更多人看到这场抗争
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.70,0:02:13.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,please make this scene.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.82,0:02:18.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,四年来我持续遭受YouTube算法的无情打压
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.82,0:02:18.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I have been bullied relentlessly by YouTube AI for four consecutive years.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.48,0:02:22.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,从未获得平台方的实质帮助
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.48,0:02:22.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I could not get any help from YouTube itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.02,0:02:25.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,其实又怎能奢望他们的援手？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.02,0:02:25.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Well, why would I even expect them to help me?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.88,0:02:30.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,连科技区创作者们也几乎无人施以援手
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.88,0:02:30.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I could barely get any help from the tech creators and it reached the climax now,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如今事态发展到频道毫无预警遭封禁
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,when my channels are just being terminated out of the blue.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.66,0:02:35.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我真心恳求各位
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.66,0:02:35.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So I really, really ask you,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.92,0:02:36.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请帮帮我
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.92,0:02:36.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,please help.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.26,0:02:38.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是求救信号
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.26,0:02:38.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is an SOS.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是背水一战
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is a Hail Mary.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,面对这个针对内容创者的系统 我毫无胜算
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I don't have a chance against this system that targets creators.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.46,0:02:47.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所有观看本视频的YouTube创作者请记住
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.46,0:02:47.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If you're a YouTube creator watching this video remember,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.74,0:02:48.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当我倒下之后
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.74,0:02:48.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,when I get terminated,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,下一个就会轮到你们
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you will be the next in line.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这套机制早已验证——
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is how it works.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.02,0:03:00.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,近期科技区Windows LTSC setups 被误判为危险软件的事件就是明证
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This has already been proven true with the recent tech
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.56,0:03:00.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,community scandal with Windows LTSC setups being flagged as harmful and dangerous.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我在2023年就遭遇过类似情况
Dialogue: 2,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This occurred to me in 2023,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但当时无人倾听
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but no one listened.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虽然其他人的视频最终解封
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And while everyone else gets their videos unblocked,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.58,0:03:08.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但问题从未真正解决
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.58,0:03:08.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's not permanent.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.78,0:03:12.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,人工智能会持续不断地标记这些视频
Dialogue: 2,0:03:08.78,0:03:12.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The AI will flag the videos again and again and again.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这事我早就经历过了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This happened to me before.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.96,0:03:18.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们不可能每次都成功发动舆论来对抗AI审查系统
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.96,0:03:18.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There is no chance for us to always generate enough backlash against the AI judge.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我还能说什么呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What else can I say?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.72,0:03:23.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,感谢您的观看
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.72,0:03:23.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Thank you for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.06,0:03:25.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这段旅程充满乐趣
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.06,0:03:25.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This has been a fun ride.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,早在2016年 当我制作第一个视频时
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Back in 2016, when I made my first video,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.92,0:03:35.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我从未料到会收获这么多新订阅者  更没想过能结识这么多优秀的人
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.92,0:03:35.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I never expected to gain so many new subscribers or to meet so many excellent people.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.78,0:03:38.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,被YouTube针对真是令人遗憾
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.78,0:03:38.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It really is a shame I'm being targeted by YouTube.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.22,0:03:41.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,821)}可以在推特
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.22,0:03:41.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,864)}You can find me on Twitter,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,821)}Odyssey找到我 我的个人网站是Enderman.ch
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,864)}Odyssey, my website is Enderman.ch,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,821)}我还有一个为支持者设立的Discord服务器
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,864)}I have a Discord server as well for supporters.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.79,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,821)}或许还有未尽之言  但此刻已无需多言
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.79,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.429,864)}II don't know if I mentioned everything,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.98,0:03:51.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但令人扼腕
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.98,0:03:51.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but shame.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实在可惜
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Shame.
